* [[Josidiah Starym]] is granted a gift from [[Anders Beltgarden]], a [[human]] wizard who settled in [[Cormanthyr]]. The gift is a newly created magical figurine of a black [[panther]] which can transform into [[Guenhwyvar]], who becomes Josidiah's friend.<ref name="C.EotE-p37">{{Cite book/Cormanthyr: Empire of the Elves|37}}</ref><ref name=tGHotR-p68/>

