{{Yearbox/misc}}
* ''Circa'': A large [[meteorite]] falls to earth near the [[Vale of Ixtzul]] in [[Far Payit]]. The impact is felt all over [[Maztica]]. The meteorite is in fact an enormous egg that hatches [[H'Calos the Star Worm]]. The beast begins to feed.<ref name=tGHotR-p73 />
* ''Circa'': The Golden Age of the [[Payit]] begins, lasting six hundred years. It is a time of peace and learning, with the sciences of astronomy, medicine, writing, and water-collection flourishing.<ref name=tGHotR-p73 />


