{{Yearbox/in-politics}}
* At the [[Council of Axe and Arrow]], the Kingdom of [[Phalorm]] is founded in [[northwest Faerûn]] in response to increasing [[orc]]ish power. The [[elves]] of [[Ardeep]], the [[dwarves]] of [[Dardath]], the [[humans]] of [[Delimbiyran]], the [[gnomes]] of [[Dolblunde]], and the [[halflings]] displaced from [[Meiritin]] unite in the Realm of Three Crowns. [[Ulbaerag Bloodhand]] rejects the invitation for [[Bloodhand Hold]] to join the kingdom.<ref name="CoS.W-p8">{{Cite book/City of Splendors: Waterdeep|8}}</ref><ref name="TGHotR-p90">{{Cite book/The Grand History of the Realms|90}}</ref>
