* Aided by an alliance with a dozen [[spirit naga]], the [[dark naga]] [[Nejizar]] takes power over the serpentfolk of the Serpent Hills. Their aims are hindered by Phalorm's expansion.<ref name="TGHotR-p90" />
* The [[Starym]] [[moon elf]] clan returns to [[Myth Drannor]] and re-establishes itself as an important house without [[Josidiah Starym]].<ref name="TGHotR-p90" />

{{Yearbox/in-people}}
* Lord [[Illitran Starym]] leaves Myth Drannor on a [[Cleansing March]], which has the aim of purify his spirit and preparing him to wield a ''[[moonblade]]''. However, he journeys to an abandoned temple of [[Moander]] and makes a pact with the imprisoned Rotting God that allows him to draw the blade without its retribution.<ref name="TGHotR-p90" />

{{Yearbox/in-environment}}
* The merchant [[Urabbastrar Tholokh]] excavates the tunnels of the [[Underdark]] beneath the realm of [[Chessenta]] using the ''[[Crown of the Mountain]]''. He delves too deep and is killed by a swarm of [[carrion crawler]]s.<ref name="DrM257-p76-80">{{Cite dragon/257/Wyrms of the North: Valamaradace}}</ref><ref name="WotN:VDQ">{{Cite web/Wyrms of the North/Valamaradace, "the Dragon Queen"}}</ref>

