{{Yearbox/in-migrations}}
* Many frightened people of western Thindol decide to flee, sailing a fleet of ships to the isle of [[Nimbral]]. However, a storm wrecks many of their vessels on the [[Beacon Rocks]]. [[Lord Samar]] of Nimbral, sympathetic to their plight and their pleas, returns the refugees to Thindol and agrees to battle the yuan-ti on their behalf.<ref name=tGHotR-p92/>

