* Following the fall of [[Phalorm]], its [[human]] kingdom, [[Delimbiyran]], lays claim to all the former lands of Phalorm and renames itself the Kingdom of Man. Delimbiyran makes alliances with the [[gnome]]s and [[halfling]]s of the region.<ref name=tGHotR-p93>{{Cite book/The Grand History of the Realms|93}}</ref>

