{{Yearbox/in-conflicts}}
* [[Iyachtu Xvim]]'s tyrannical rule of [[Westgate]] is ended when he is driven out by [[Farnath Ilistar]], the rightful heir to the throne, at the head of a mercenary army.<ref name=FRCS3e>{{Cite book/Forgotten Realms Campaign Setting 3rd edition|144}}</ref><ref name=tGHotR-p101>{{Cite book/The Grand History of the Realms|101}}</ref>

{{Yearbox/in-migrations}}
* [[Vhaeraun]] warns the [[drow]] of [[Chaulssin]] of an impending attack, and they retreat into the [[Plane of Shadow]]. A few days later, drow from [[Menzoberranzan]] invade the city but find it empty of people. Amidst frequent attacks by monsters from the Shadow Plane, the Menzoberranzanyr drow claim victory anyway and leave. The Chaulssinyr, meanwhile establish [[Chaul'mur'ssin]], the Shadow City, on the Shadow Plane itself.<ref name=tGHotR-p101/>

{{Yearbox/in-people}}
* [[Raulbaera]], the so-called "Maiden King" and descendant of [[Ulbaereg Bloodhand]], lays claims to the lands around what is later the village of [[Amphail (village)|Amphail]]. There she founds the settlement of [[Rowan Hold]].<ref name="tGHotR-p101" />

{{Yearbox/misc}}
* The ''[[Greatsword of Impiltur]]'', forged by the [[dwarves]] of [[Earthfast]] to mark the coronation of King [[Sarshel Elethim]] of [[Impiltur]], is completed.<ref name="CoR-138">{{Cite book/Champions of Ruin|138}}</ref>  


