* [[Drow]] ambush a [[dwarf|dwarven]] mining expedition traveling through tunnels of the [[Underdark]] beneath the [[Trackless Sea]]. During the fighting, a deep core fissure erupts, flooding a gallery with magma. Many are slain on each side, leaving only a handful of survivors, who each believe the other side has been wiped out. The battle becomes known as "[[Rockfire]]".<ref name=GHR>{{Cite book/The Grand History of the Realms|113}}</ref>

{{Yearbox/in-migrations}}
