* Priests of [[Bhaal]] travelling from eastern [[Amn]] slaughter all whom they encounter until they reach [[Westgate]], most notably [[Raevarl's Circle]], a group of [[Silvanus|Silvanite]] priests living in a small forest (that no longer exists) south west of the city. The Bhaalites are defeated by a hastily assembled mercenary army.<ref>{{Cite book/Prayers from the Faithful|51}}</ref>

{{Yearbox/in-organizations}}
* The [[Shadow Thieves]] are formed by [[Marune|Marune "the Masked"]] and they begin to operate in [[Waterdeep]].<ref name="CoS.CG-p30">{{Cite book/City of Splendors (boxed set)/Campaign Guide|30}}</ref><ref name="TGHotR-126"/> The guild is based out of [[Mount Waterdeep]].<ref name="TGHotR-126">{{Cite book/The Grand History of the Realms|126}}</ref>

