{{Yearbox/in-people}}
* [[Daeros Dragonspear]], the famed [[half-dwarf]] adventurer, explores the lost underground city of [[Kanaglym]], which lies in the depths of the [[Hunnabar|Duchy of Hunnabar]] of [[Phalorm]]. He seizes a hoard of gems from a [[beholder]] dwelling there and survives, then decides to retire. Daeros then constructs [[Dragonspear Castle]] at the site of the lair of the [[copper dragon]] [[Halatathlaer]]. Dwarves are welcomed there, and they settled in the castle's outer ward.<ref name="TGHotR-127">{{Cite book/The Grand History of the Realms|127}}</ref>


