|year=1261
|age=Age of Humanity}}
{{LunarCalendarBox}}

{{Yearbox/in-conflicts}}
* Furious [[Talos]]-worshipers from the [[Vilhon Reach]] burn down the tavern in [[Kurrsh]] that holds the ''[[Chanting Chain]]''. Their return journey is marked by looting and butchering all who they meet along the way. Their travels are dubbed the "[[Slaughter of the Crazed]]" but they are stopped by militiamen near [[Shamph]]. Many of the Talassans escape, including the one with the ''Chain'', but their depredations, at least, are halted.<ref>{{Cite book/Prayers from the Faithful|19}}</ref>

{{Yearbox/in-politics}}
* [[Azoun III]] assumes the throne of [[Cormyr]].<ref name="tGHotR-p77">{{Cite book/The Grand History of the Realms|77}}</ref>
* [[Manshoon]] and [[Chess]] claim their seats as Lords on the [[Zhentil Keep]] council.<ref name="tGHotR-p128">{{Cite book/The Grand History of the Realms|128}}</ref><ref name="RoZK.CB-p14">{{Cite book/Ruins of Zhentil Keep/Campaign Book|14}}</ref><ref name="RoZK.CB-p28">{{Cite book/Ruins of Zhentil Keep/Campaign Book|28}}</ref>
* [[Halacar]], king of [[Aglarond]], is poisoned and dies. His sister, the [[sorceress]] [[Ilione]], becomes queen of [[Aglarond]].<ref name="tGHotR-p128"/>
* An evil spirit steals the soul of Emperor [[Wai Juku A'ti]] of [[T'u Lung]] and he dies. Initially, [[wu jen]] of [[Shou Lung]] are blamed, and [[Shou]] natives are persecuted, but evidence later points to a rival family or cult within T'u Lung.<ref name="tGHotR-p128"/>
* [[Wai Chi Con]], eldest son of Juku A'ti, dies in a boating accident shortly after his father's death. [[Wai Lo Yan]], the young and sickly second son, becomes T'u Lung's seventh emperor. Finding him weak, politicians at court and baronial clans work intrigues and prosper.<ref name="tGHotR-p128"/>

{{Yearbox/in-people}}
* [[Ashemmi]] leaves her home in [[Neverwinter Woods]], traveling to [[Neverwinter]] and joining the [[Bright Banner Brandished]].<ref name="RoD-p74">{{Cite dragon/357/Volo's Guide: Renegades of Darkhold|74}}</ref>

{{Yearbox/in-organizations}}
* Manshoon establishes the covert organization known as the [[Zhentarim]].<ref name="tGHotR-p128"/><ref name="RoZK.CB-p14"/><ref name="RoZK.CB-p28"/>

{{Yearbox/deaths}}
* Lord [[Ulsan Baneservant]] of Zhentil Keep is killed by the combined efforts of Manshoon, Chess, and [[Fzoul Chembryl]].<ref name="RoZK.CB-p14"/>
* The Revered Counselor [[Zomoc]] is found dead by his slaves, curled up in a state of terror that killed him. The [[Nexal]]an nobility selects the next Revered Counselor, [[Izco]]<ref name="maz">{{Cite book/Maztica Campaign Set/A Journey to the True World|27-29}}</ref>

