{{Yearbox/in-environment}}
* The [[Great Plague of the Inner Sea]]. The lands around the [[Sea of Fallen Stars]] are beset by three distinct [[plague]]s:
** The [[Plague of Dragons]]&mdash;called such for causing victim's skin to flake and driving them mad&mdash;spreads through the [[Vilhon Reach]] and hits [[Chessenta]] and [[Unther]] hard. It lasts for six years in the Reach, and seven in Chessenta and Unther. [[Mulhorand]] largely escapes the plague, and [[Thay]] withdraws its presence from the [[Wizards' Reach]] by [[1320 DR]] to avoid the disease.<ref name="tGHotR-p134"/><ref>{{Cite book/Unapproachable East|163}}</ref>
** [[Impiltur]] and parts of [[The Vast]] are struck by a disease that infests the body with [[maggot]]s and transforms the infected into [[undead]] horrors. It is apparently spready by a [[dragon]] known as the [[Wandering Wyrm]].<ref name="tGHotR-p134" />
** [[Aglarond]] is struck by yet a third disease.<ref name="tGHotR-p134" />

