* [[Azoun V]] is crowned king of [[Cormyr]]. His first major act as king is to attempt to set up a jury system in Cormyrian law courts. He faces stiff opposition from the nobles as it would mean that any legal accusations they make against commoners would not automatically be settled in their favour. He eventually relents under the political pressure, but vows that one day he will successfully enact his decree.<ref name="GHotR-159">{{Cite book/The Grand History of the Realms|159}}</ref>
